# 🚀 Node.js Auth & Payment API (MVC Pattern)
## 🙋‍♂️ zain

**sainul abid k**  
📧 [wwwzainzaan@gmail.com]  
🔗 [GitHub](https://github.com/zainmp-dev/payment-integration.git) | [LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/in/sainul-abid-k-6040a326b/)

A secure backend API built using **Node.js**, **Express**, and **MongoDB** following the **MVC architecture**. It includes:

- ✅ User Authentication (Register/Login)
- ✅ JWT for Auth Tokens
- ✅ CSRF Protection with Cookie support
- ✅ Input Validation using Joi
- ✅ Stripe Payment Integration (Checkout & PaymentIntent)
- ✅ Secure HTTP headers with Helmet
- ✅ API Rate Limiting
- ✅ Centralized Error Handling

---

